---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="How HVAC Boot Camp Works | Learn, Check, and Prepare for the Field"
  description="See how HVAC Boot Camp combines focused online lessons, learning assistance, quick checks, instructor support, and career preparation."
>
  <div class="standard-page">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="page-hero-inner narrow-hero">
        <p class="eyebrow">How HVAC Boot Camp works</p>
        <h1>A clear path from <span>“I am new”</span> to “I can explain this.”</h1>
        <p>The course teaches the technical foundation in small steps, helps when a concept is difficult, and connects what you learn to an entry-level HVAC path.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="/try-boot-camp/">Try the lesson format</a><a class="button button-secondary" href="/pricing/">View pricing</a></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-section">
      <div class="page-shell">
        <div class="section-heading center"><p class="eyebrow">The learning loop</p><h2>Every page has one job.</h2><p>You should never have to wonder what to focus on or what to do next.</p></div>
        <div class="how-steps">
          <article><span>01</span><div><p class="step-label">Learn</p><h3>Focus on one concept</h3><p>Read a short explanation, view the relevant visual or video, and stay with one idea at a time.</p></div></article>
          <article><span>02</span><div><p class="step-label">Interact</p><h3>Ask for the kind of help you need</h3><p>Request a simpler explanation, another HVAC example, why it matters, or an answer limited to the current lesson.</p></div></article>
          <article><span>03</span><div><p class="step-label">Check</p><h3>Prove the idea makes sense</h3><p>Answer a short knowledge check and receive immediate, useful feedback instead of waiting for a large quiz.</p></div></article>
          <article><span>04</span><div><p class="step-label">Continue</p><h3>Move forward with visible progress</h3><p>Continue to the next concept or revisit the one that needs more work. Your place remains clear.</p></div></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-section soft-section">
      <div class="page-shell split-feature">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">AI with boundaries</p>
          <h2>Help with this lesson—not an endless chat window.</h2>
          <p>The planned tutor receives the current page, approved lesson material, instructor notes, and only the recent context needed to help. It is not allowed to wander across the entire course.</p>
          <a class="text-link-dark" href="/try-boot-camp/">See the interaction pattern →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="boundary-card">
          <p>On a lesson page, ask:</p>
          <ul class="plain-check-list"><li>Explain this more simply</li><li>Give me an HVAC example</li><li>Why do I need to know this?</li><li>Quiz me on this concept</li><li>Answer my question about this page</li></ul>
          <small>The final live-AI behavior will be connected after the Unit 1 content review.</small>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-section">
      <div class="page-shell">
        <div class="section-heading center"><p class="eyebrow">More than course content</p><h2>The training path includes the next real-world step.</h2></div>
        <div class="outcome-grid">
          <article><span>Technical</span><h3>Build the foundation</h3><p>Study refrigeration, heat, tools, safety, airflow, electricity, systems, and troubleshooting in order.</p></article>
          <article><span>Support</span><h3>Do not stay stuck</h3><p>Use focused lesson help and reach Ron when a difficult idea needs instructor attention.</p></article>
          <article><span>Career</span><h3>Prepare to approach employers</h3><p>Identify companies, prepare an introduction, develop an OJT plan, and practice the interview.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-section dark-panel-section">
      <div class="page-shell support-panel">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">Online does not mean alone</p><h2>Ron stays part of the course.</h2><p>The technology is there to make explanations available at the moment of confusion. It does not replace instructor judgment, accountability, or the ability to ask for help.</p></div>
        <a class="button button-primary" href="https://www.hvactrainingsolutions.net/find-out-more/">Talk to Ron</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-section final-cta">
      <div class="page-shell"><p class="eyebrow">Your next step</p><h2>See how one lesson feels.</h2><p>Try the short preview before reviewing the complete course and payment options.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="/try-boot-camp/">Try a lesson</a><a class="button button-secondary" href="/hvac-boot-camp/">Explore Boot Camp</a></div></div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
